---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const nav = `<strong>Start</strong><a href="/docs">Overview</a><a href="/docs/quickstart" class="active">Quickstart</a><strong>Build</strong><a href="/docs/api">API reference</a><a href="/docs/integrations">SDK &amp; frameworks</a><a href="/docs/multilingual">Multilingual</a><strong>Run</strong><a href="/docs/hosting">Hosting</a><a href="/docs/security">Security</a>`;
---
<Base title="Memflex quickstart — 5 minutes, no API key" desc="Install, first ask, first reflex hit, metrics." path="/docs/quickstart">
<div class="wrap" style="padding:64px 24px">
  <span class="eyebrow">Docs · Quickstart</span>
  <h1>5 minutes, no API key.</h1>
  <div class="docs-grid" style="margin-top:30px">
    <nav class="docs-nav" set:html={nav}></nav>
    <div class="doc">
      <h2>1 · Install &amp; run</h2>
      <div class="codeblock"><button class="copy">Copy</button><pre>pip install memflex
cp .env.example .env
EMBEDDING_BACKEND=hash python -m reflex.api.app  # :8000
# open http://localhost:8000/docs (Swagger UI)</pre></div>
      <h2>2 · First ask (thinks, memorizes)</h2>
      <p>In <code>/docs</code>, <code>POST /ask → Try it out</code>:</p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button class="copy">Copy</button><pre>&#123;"user_id": "u123", "message": "When will my refund arrive?", "llm": "mock/mock-echo"&#125;</pre></div>
      <p>→ <code>"source": "llm"</code>. System 2 thought, then saved a reflex.</p>
      <h2>3 · Ask again (memory, ₹0)</h2>
      <p>Execute once more → <code>"source": "reflex", "confidence": 0.9</code>. No LLM call. Then try it in another language — German (<code>"Wo ist meine Rückerstattung?"</code>) or Spanish (<code>"¿Dónde está mi entrega?"</code>) run the same loop.</p>
      <h2>4 · Watch the money</h2>
      <div class="codeblock"><button class="copy">Copy</button><pre>curl http://localhost:8000/metrics
# hit_rate, avg_latency_ms, cost_saved_30d_inr, calibration[]</pre></div>
      <p>Next: <a href="/docs/api">API reference</a> · <a href="/docs/integrations">plug in your agent</a> · <a href="/how-it-works">how it works</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
